WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.158
- Welcome back, y'all, we're
here with Chrissy Teigan

00:00:02.158 --> 00:00:03.085
and David Chang!

00:00:03.085 --> 00:00:05.087
(audience applauds)

00:00:05.087 --> 00:00:06.160
Together they've got a new show

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.190
called "Chrissy &amp; Dave Dine Out".

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.080
You can see it Wednesdays on Freeform

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.000
and streaming the next day on Hulu.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.640
The show covers a bunch of
different categories of food

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:18.210
so it's time to test how
well Chrissy and I...

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:21.270
I will not, but I know some
of those different categories-

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:23.070
- Girl, I am not good at games.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:24.210
- You know food!

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.357
Anyway, this is "Quick Quick Categories".

00:00:27.357 --> 00:00:29.885
♪ Quick Quick Categories ♪

00:00:29.885 --> 00:00:31.091
- [Kelly] Okay!

00:00:31.091 --> 00:00:31.950
- [Chrissy] There we go,
Quick Quick Categories.

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:33.060
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.610
From that vocal I got hints
of, remember "Hercules"?

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.660
The singers on the "Hercules" soundtrack?

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.510
I love it!

00:00:39.510 --> 00:00:41.610
Gave me those vibes, you
should check it out, anyway...

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.020
Thank you for hosting.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.790
I know that you're so excited about it.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:46.404
- I was born for this moment, yeah.

00:00:46.404 --> 00:00:47.237
(David laughs)

00:00:47.237 --> 00:00:48.300
- Alright, tell us, here we go.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.390
- Alright folks, in this
game I will give a category

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.670
of something that has to do with food,

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:57.210
might be brands of food,
might be types of restaurants.

00:00:57.210 --> 00:01:00.150
Kelly and Chrissy will
take turns naming things

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:02.160
within that specific category.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.220
When someone gets one
wrong, repeats an answer,

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:08.550
or takes longer than
three seconds to answer,

00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:09.623
you'll hear this sound:

00:01:09.623 --> 00:01:11.100
(buzzer sounds)

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:11.933
- I'm gonna throw up.

00:01:11.933 --> 00:01:13.549
(audience laughs)

00:01:13.549 --> 00:01:15.510
(Chrissy laughs nervously)

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:18.450
- I don't even understand
the rules, so I am like...

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.640
- If you get the buzzer,
that means the other person

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:21.750
gets the point.

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.131
I also don't understand what's going on.

00:01:23.131 --> 00:01:24.810
(Chrissy laughs)
- Should go great.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:26.280
- Kelly is playing to win a prize

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.609
for the left of the audience.

00:01:27.609 --> 00:01:31.050
(left side of audience cheers)

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:34.482
Chrissy is playing for the
right side over by the band.

00:01:34.482 --> 00:01:36.780
(right side of audience cheers)

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:37.613
- Are you guys ready?

00:01:37.613 --> 00:01:38.446
- Yes!

00:01:38.446 --> 00:01:39.279
- Eh...

00:01:39.279 --> 00:01:40.620
- Alright, category one.

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:41.453
- Okay.

00:01:41.453 --> 00:01:42.487
- [David] Chrissy starts.

00:01:42.487 --> 00:01:44.610
"Kitchen Appliances".

00:01:44.610 --> 00:01:46.950
- Oh, food processor.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:47.783
- Blender.

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:49.824
- Why you looking at me?

00:01:49.824 --> 00:01:52.050
(David and the audience laugh)

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:53.223
- Ice cream maker.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.421
- Ice maker.

00:01:56.421 --> 00:01:57.933
Ah, cheated, kinda.

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:00.840
- A Ninja.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.490
Is that a..?

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:04.430
- Kind of a blender but yeah.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:05.880
(Kelly laughs)

00:02:05.880 --> 00:02:07.470
So, um...

00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:09.207
So, an oven.
(buzzer sounds)

00:02:09.207 --> 00:02:10.080
- Oh!

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:14.880
Oh my God, we won!
(audience cheers)

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:17.490
I know for a fact you let me have that

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:19.680
because you are so good at games

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:20.743
- You should know me better than that,

00:02:20.743 --> 00:02:21.593
I don't let anyone win.

00:02:21.593 --> 00:02:24.480
I don't even let my seven year old win!

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:25.920
- Alright, category two.

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:26.910
Kelly, ready?

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:27.743
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:27.743 --> 00:02:29.430
- "Soft Drink Brands".

00:02:29.430 --> 00:02:30.480
- Oh, Dr. Pepper.

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.280
- That's my favorite!

00:02:32.280 --> 00:02:33.113
Coke.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.220
- Pepsi.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:36.360
- Mountain Dew.

00:02:36.360 --> 00:02:37.860
- Sprite.

00:02:37.860 --> 00:02:39.300
- Squirt.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:40.133
- Fanta.

00:02:40.133 --> 00:02:42.570
(audience laughs)

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:43.710
- La Croix.

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:44.543
- Oh, (beep).

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.060
Dr. Thunder!

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:49.467
It's the off-brand...

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:52.785
- The off-brand Dr. Pepper?
(buzzer sounds)

00:02:52.785 --> 00:02:56.057
(audience cheers)

00:02:56.057 --> 00:02:57.391
That's what my mom would buy-

00:02:57.391 --> 00:03:00.450
- That's what we would buy!

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:02.100
- Next category.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:04.620
- Chrissy, "Shapes of Pasta".

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.120
Shapes of pasta.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:07.426
- Fusilli.

00:03:07.426 --> 00:03:08.259
- What?

00:03:08.259 --> 00:03:09.213
(audience laughs)

00:03:09.213 --> 00:03:11.460
Penne.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.900
- Bucatini.

00:03:12.900 --> 00:03:14.043
- Spaghetti.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.920
- Lasagna.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.369
- Angel hair.

00:03:18.369 --> 00:03:19.710
- That's a good one.

00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:21.209
Cavatappi.

00:03:21.209 --> 00:03:22.347
(David laughs)

00:03:22.347 --> 00:03:24.083
- She heard me!

00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:24.916
- Cavatelli.

00:03:24.916 --> 00:03:25.911
- You said it wrong!

00:03:25.911 --> 00:03:27.577
- Cavatelli!
- Cavatelli!

00:03:27.577 --> 00:03:29.660
- Yes!
(buzzer sounds)

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:32.493
(audience cheers)

00:03:33.802 --> 00:03:35.468
- What's cavatappi?

00:03:35.468 --> 00:03:36.548
Cavatappi!

00:03:36.548 --> 00:03:37.771
You never had a cavatappi?

00:03:37.771 --> 00:03:39.420
- Here is the thing, I didn't know,

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.220
so you could've gotten away with it.

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.850
- I just remembered Fusilli
Jerry from "Seinfeld"

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.410
and that's, like, my only reference.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.603
- Alright, Kelly, category:

00:03:48.817 --> 00:03:51.938
"Foods That Start with The Letter J".

00:03:51.938 --> 00:03:53.520
- Jackfruit.

00:03:53.520 --> 00:03:55.920
- That's really good and very Asian.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:58.903
- [Kelly] Okay.
(audience laughs)

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:01.381
- Jam.

00:04:01.381 --> 00:04:03.540
(David laughs)

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.929
- Jell-O.

00:04:04.929 --> 00:04:07.687
(Kelly gasps)

00:04:07.687 --> 00:04:09.174
(buzzer sounds)

00:04:09.174 --> 00:04:12.007
(audience cheers)

00:04:13.161 --> 00:04:14.638
- I still can't think of one.

00:04:14.638 --> 00:04:15.780
- I don't know either, jam...

00:04:15.780 --> 00:04:16.740
- [Kelly] Jelly bean!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.730
- Jelly bean.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.230
- I was sticking with Jell-O.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:20.760
- [Chrissy] Once you get it, yeah...

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:21.813
- I don't know.

00:04:21.813 --> 00:04:22.939
(air horn blares)

00:04:22.939 --> 00:04:24.000
(Kelly imitates air horn)

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:25.710
- Last category, last category.

00:04:25.710 --> 00:04:27.990
- You're killing it, by the way, dude.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.377
- I'm gonna honestly throw up.

00:04:29.377 --> 00:04:30.979
- "Fast Food Restaurants".

00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:32.883
- Oh yeah, baby!

00:04:32.883 --> 00:04:33.810
Burger King!

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:35.040
- Taco Bell.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:35.873
- McDonald's.

00:04:35.873 --> 00:04:36.810
- Whataburger.

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:37.770
- Del Taco.

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:39.414
- Dairy Queen.

00:04:39.414 --> 00:04:41.820
(Chrissy and the audience laugh)

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:42.653
- A&amp;W.

00:04:42.653 --> 00:04:43.486
- KFC.

00:04:44.490 --> 00:04:45.390
- Popeye's.

00:04:45.390 --> 00:04:46.860
- Oh, good!

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.210
Chicken Express.

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.230
- Shake Shack.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.270
- Oh, (beep), Schlotzsky's.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.320
- Chick-fil-A.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:53.994
- Is Shake Shack a fast food?

00:04:53.994 --> 00:04:55.230
- Yes, yes, yes.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.250
- Oh, okay.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.773
And then, sorry, Taco Bueno.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.113
- El Pollo Loco?

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:02.873
- Kinda.

00:05:02.873 --> 00:05:03.706
- [David] It's not Jeopardy.

00:05:03.706 --> 00:05:06.630
- Okay, oh, Wendy's.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:07.463
- Oh that's a good one.

00:05:07.463 --> 00:05:08.868
Oh, no, no, no, no...

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:10.597
(Chrissy babbles anxiously)

00:05:10.597 --> 00:05:12.964
(buzzer sounds)

00:05:12.964 --> 00:05:16.546
- Yes!
(air horns blare)

00:05:16.546 --> 00:05:17.379
Finally!

00:05:21.247 --> 00:05:24.150
That's when being a
closet fat kid works out!

00:05:24.150 --> 00:05:25.747
That's all I'm saying!

00:05:25.747 --> 00:05:27.570
♪ Yeah ♪

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:28.500
You ain't gonna beat me!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.923
You're too scared to beat me at fast food!

00:05:30.923 --> 00:05:33.160
(Chrissy and the audience laugh)

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:36.630
Everyone, everyone wins on
the Kelly Clarkson Show!

